"{\n \"h1count\": 1,\n \"lang\": \"en\",\n \"height\": 10532,\n \"fonts\": [\n  \"Inter, sans-serif\",\n  \"\\\"Playfair Display\\\", serif\"\n ],\n \"secs\": [\n  {\n   \"i\": 0,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"\",\n   \"cls\": \"\",\n   \"h\": [],\n   \"text\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 1,\n   \"tag\": \"NAV\",\n   \"id\": \"\",\n   \"cls\": \"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-500 bg-navy/95 backdrop-\",\n   \"h\": [],\n   \"text\": \"E Elite Medical CONCIERGE About Us Services Facilities Dashboard Video Consultation Contact 🇬🇧 Chat Emergency Line\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 2,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"\",\n   \"cls\": \"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H1: World Class Healthcare\\nIn World Class Hotels\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"ELITE VIP MEDICAL CONCIERGE · TRUSTED BY 50+ HOTELS World Class Healthcare In World Class Hotels Experience stress-free medical care with internationally accredited doctors, mobile diagnostics, and 24/7 concierge service—all within your luxury resort. 24/7 Available Request Consultation Our Services 15,000+ PATIENTS SERVED 150+ LUXURY HOTELS 4.9/5 PATIENT RATING 8 REGIONS COVERED 24/7 In Hotel On Call Service Cashless Insurance Coverage Certified EU & US Doctors 10+ Languages Multilingual Care \\\"Exceptional care when we needed it most. The doctor arrived within 30 minutes and spoke perfect German. Truly world-class service.\\\" MK Michael K. — Steigenberger Hurghada\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 3,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"\",\n   \"cls\": \"py-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-navy via-navy-light to-navy overflow-hidden\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H2: Your Trusted Healthcare Partner Across Egypt\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"TRUSTED BY 150+ LUXURY HOTELS & RESORTS Your Trusted Healthcare Partner Across Egypt HOTEL PARTNERS INSURANCE COVERAGE TOUR OPERATORS & ACCREDITATIONS Partnered with 50+ luxury hotels and 20+ insurance providers across Egypt\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 4,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"services\",\n   \"cls\": \"py-24 bg-cream\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H2: Our Services\",\n    \"H3: On-Call Specialist Doctors\",\n    \"H3: Mobile Radiology\",\n    \"H3: Laboratory Services\",\n    \"H3: Intermediate Care Unit\",\n    \"H3: Multilingual Coordinators\",\n    \"H3: Medical Procedures\",\n    \"H3: Medication Delivery\",\n    \"H3: Escort & Transfer\",\n    \"H3: Insurance Liaison\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"COMPREHENSIVE MEDICAL CARE Our Services From emergency response to specialist consultations, we bring hospital-quality care to your hotel. On-Call Specialist Doctors Double-certified physicians from Egypt and Europe, available 24/7 at your hotel location. Mobile Radiology State-of-the-art portable imaging services brought directly to hotel clinics. Laboratory Services Comprehensive diagnostic testing with rapid results, all within your hotel premises. Intermediate Care Unit Professional observation and monitoring for patients requiring extended care. Multilingual Coordinators Dedicated case managers fluent in multiple languages ensuring seamless communication. Medical Procedures Minor procedures and treatments performed in accredited hotel clinic settings. Medication Delivery Prescription and medical supplies delivered directly to your room. Escort & Transfer Full coordination and escort services when external medical facilities are needed. Insurance Liaison Cashless services with major insurers and complete documentation handling.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 5,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"\",\n   \"cls\": \"py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-background to-muted/30\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H2: Experience Elite Healthcare\",\n    \"H3: Elite Private Clinics\",\n    \"H3: Urgent Care Centers\",\n    \"H3: Elite Medical Staff\",\n    \"H3: Portable Diagnostics\",\n    \"H3: Intermediate Care Units\",\n    \"H3: Ground Ambulance Fleet\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"World-Class Facilities Experience Elite Healthcare Our state-of-the-art facilities and equipment ensure you receive the highest quality medical care in a luxurious, comfortable environment. Every detail is designed with your well-being in mind. Luxury Premium Elite Private Clinics State-of-the-art luxury medical facilities with premium amenities, marble interiors, and a welcoming atmosphere designed for your comfort. 24/7 Equipped Urgent Care Centers Fully equipped examination rooms with the latest medical technology, vital monitors, and advanced diagnostic equipment for immediate care. Multilingual Certified Elite Medical Staff Our diverse team of board-certified physicians, specialists, and multilingual coordinators ensures personalized care in your preferred language. X-Ray Ultrasound Lab Portable Diagnostics Mobile X-ray, ultrasound, and comprehensive lab testing equipment brought directly to your location for convenient diagnostics. Private Monitored Intermediate Care Units Private luxury care suites with advanced monitoring systems, comfortable accommodations, and dedicated nursing staff for extended recovery. ALS ICU-Ready Ground Ambulance Fleet Modern advanced life support ambulances with fully equipped mobile ICU capabilities for safe and rapid patient transport. Multilingual Staff Coordinators in 10+ languages On-Site Diagnostics X-ray, ultrasound & labs Emergency Transport Ground ambulance fleet Premium Facilities Luxury care environment\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 6,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"why-us\",\n   \"cls\": \"py-24 bg-navy relative overflow-hidden\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H2: Why Guests Trust\\nOur Elite Care\",\n    \"H3: 24/7 Immediate Response\",\n    \"H3: Stress-Free Experience\",\n    \"H3: Surrounded by Care\",\n    \"H3: Multilingual Excellence\",\n    \"H3: Complete Coordination\",\n    \"H3: European Standards\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"THE ELITE DIFFERENCE Why Guests Trust Our Elite Care We don't just provide medical services—we deliver peace of mind, ensuring every guest receives care with compassion and excellence. 24/7 Immediate Response Round-the-clock availability ensures you receive care exactly when you need it, any hour of day or night. Stress-Free Experience No hospital transfers, no paperwork hassles. We handle everything while you focus on recovery. Surrounded by Care Heal in the comfort of your hotel, supported by family, friends, and our dedicated medical team. Multilingual Excellence Our international team ensures seamless communication in your preferred language. Complete Coordination We liaise with hotels, travel agents, insurers, and families to ensure unified, comprehensive care. European Standards Our physicians hold dual certifications and adhere to the highest international medical protocols. 15+ PARTNER HOTELS 50+ SPECIALIST DOCTORS 24/7 AVAILABILITY 100% GUEST SATISFACTION\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 7,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"\",\n   \"cls\": \"py-24 bg-navy relative overflow-hidden\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H2: Seamless Care in\\nFour Simple Steps\",\n    \"H3: Contact Our Team\",\n    \"H3: Coordinator Assigned\",\n    \"H3: Doctor Arrives\",\n    \"H3: Complete Care\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"HOW IT WORKS Seamless Care in Four Simple Steps 01 Contact Our Team Reach us 24/7 through your hotel concierge or our emergency line for immediate assistance. 02 Coordinator Assigned A multilingual care coordinator is assigned to manage your case and handle all communications. 03 Doctor Arrives A certified specialist visits you at your hotel, equipped with necessary medical supplies. 04 Complete Care From treatment to follow-up, we ensure your recovery with ongoing support and coordination.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 8,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"accreditations\",\n   \"cls\": \"py-24 bg-cream-dark\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H2: Accredited Excellence\\nYou Can Trust\",\n    \"H3: International Standards\",\n    \"H3: Global Healthcare Accreditation\",\n    \"H3: German Medical Association\",\n    \"H3: Urgent Care Association\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"INTERNATIONAL RECOGNITION Accredited Excellence You Can Trust Our clinics meet the highest international standards, ensuring you receive world-class care validated by leading global healthcare organizations. Double international certified physicians (Egypt, Europe & USA) ISO 9001 Quality Management International patient safety protocols HIPAA-compliant data handling Emergency response certification Advanced life support training International Standards Our physicians are double international certified following American and European medical protocols and guidelines Global Healthcare Accreditation Excellence in medical tourism and international patient care German Medical Association European standards certification for medical practice Urgent Care Association Certified excellence in urgent care delivery and patient-centered emergency services \\\"Delivering healthcare excellence with international standards in Egypt's most prestigious hotels\\\"\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 9,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"partners\",\n   \"cls\": \"py-24 bg-cream\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H2: Elite Partners in\\nHospitality & Insurance\",\n    \"H3: Luxury Hotels & Resorts\",\n    \"H3: Insurance Partners\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"TRUSTED PARTNERSHIPS Elite Partners in Hospitality & Insurance We partner with World Class Hotels, resorts, and leading travel insurance companies to provide seamless medical services for our guests. Luxury Hotels & Resorts Marriott Hotels & Resorts Fairmont Hotels & Resorts Accor Hotels & Resorts Hilton Hotels & Resorts Steigenberger Hotels & Resorts JAZ Hotels & Resorts Rixos Hotels & Resorts SunRise Hotels & Resorts Fo Four Seasons Hotels & Resorts Hy Hyatt Hotels & Resorts In InterContinental Hotels & Resorts Ma Mandarin Oriental Hotels & Resorts Sh Shangri-La Hotels & Resorts Ke Kempinski Hotels & Resorts Th The Ritz-Carlton Hotels & Resorts Insurance Partners Allianz Insurance AXA Insurance Cigna Insurance Bupa Insurance MetLife Insurance Generali Insurance Don't see your hotel or insurance provider? Contact us to verify your coverage. We work with 50+ international partners\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 10,\n   \"tag\": \"SECTION\",\n   \"id\": \"contact\",\n   \"cls\": \"py-24 bg-cream-dark\",\n   \"h\": [\n    \"H2: Our Service Areas\",\n    \"H2: Need Medical Assistance?\\nWe're Here For You\",\n    \"H3: Request Callback\"\n   ],\n   \"text\": \"COVERAGE ACROSS EGYPT Our Service Areas Click on any location to explore our coverage across Egypt's most popular destinations. Loading map... Cairo Alexandria Hurghada Sharm El Sheikh El Gouna Marsa Alam Alamein Marsa Matrouh Dahab Luxor Aswan Elite Hospital - Cairo (Nasr City) Elite Hospital - Cairo (Maadi) Elite Hospital - Cairo (6th October) Elite Hospital - Giza Elite Hospital - Alexandria Elite Hospital - Hurghada Elite Hospital - Sharm El Sheikh Elite Hospital - Luxor GET IN TOUCH Need Medical Assistance? We're Here For You Our team is available around the clock to provide immediate medical assistance. Whether it's an emergency or a routine health concern, we're just a call away. Emergency Hotline +20 120 678 8566 24/7 Available Email Us info@medcierge.com | care@medcierge.com Instant Response Service Areas Cairo, Alexandria, Red Sea, Sinai, Nile Valley Including Hurghada, Sharm El Sheikh, Alamein, Marsa Matrouh, Dahab, Luxor, Aswan & more Availability 24 Hours / 7 Days Including holidays Request Callback Full Name Phone Number Hotel / Resort How can we help? Request Callback For emergencies, please call our hotline directly.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"i\": 11,\n   \"tag\": \"FOOTER\",\n   \"id\": \"\",\n   \"cls\": \"bg-navy py-16\",\n   \"h\": [],\n   \"text\": \"E Elite Medical CONCIERGE Delivering world-class healthcare with the warmth of Egyptian hospitality. info@medcierge.com care@medcierge.com Quick Links Services Why Choose Us Accreditations Partners Contact Service Areas Hurghada Cairo Alexandria Sharm E